---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="footer-inner">
		<div class="footer-info">
			<p class="footer-title">K잇핏</p>
			<p>IT/디지털 제품 비교 리뷰 블로그</p>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-links">
			<a href="/">홈</a>
			<a href="/blog">전체 글</a>
			<a href="/about">소개</a>
		</div>
		<p class="copyright">&copy; {today.getFullYear()} 잇픽. All rights reserved.</p>
	</div>
</footer>
<style>
	footer {
		border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		background: white;
		padding: 3em 1em;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		text-align: center;
	}
	.footer-inner {
		max-width: 960px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.footer-title {
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 1.1em;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		margin-bottom: 0.3em;
	}
	.footer-links {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1.5em;
		margin: 1em 0;
	}
	.footer-links a {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.footer-links a:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	.copyright {
		font-size: 0.8em;
		margin: 1em 0 0;
	}
</style>
